+      <h2>Winter Reading Circle</h2>
+      <p><time datetime="2026-11-28T18:30">Saturday 28 November 2026, 6:30 pm</time></p>
+      <p class="event-desc">Bring the book you are halfway through and a cold drink. We read a short story aloud, then talk for an hour about what we are holding back.</p>
+      <p class="event-booking">Booking: needed. Seats are limited to 14.</p>
+    </li>
+    <li class="event">
+      <h2>Gift Wrap and Cocoa Afternoon</h2>
+      <p><time datetime="2026-12-05T14:00">Saturday 5 December 2026, 2:00 pm</time></p>
+      <p class="event-desc">Bring your own presents or pick from our wrapping station. Hot cocoa is on the house while the paper lasts.</p>
+      <p class="event-booking">Booking: not needed. Drop in any time before 4:00 pm.</p>
+    </li>
+    <li class="event">
+      <h2>Poetry Open Mic</h2>
+      <p><time datetime="2027-01-14T19:00">Thursday 14 January 2027, 7:00 pm</time></p>
+      <p class="event-desc">Three minutes each, any form, any subject. Listeners are welcome, and the shop stays open late for anyone who wants to browse afterwards.</p>
+      <p class="event-booking">Booking: needed for performers. Listeners need no booking.</p>
+    </li>
+    <li class="event">
+      <h2>Story Hour for Early Readers</h2>
+      <p><time datetime="2027-01-16T10:30">Saturday 16 January 2027, 10:30 am</time></p>
+      <p class="event-desc">Half an hour of picture books and songs for children aged three to six, with a short craft table afterwards.</p>
+      <p class="event-booking">Booking: not needed. Come along and sit on the rug.</p>
+    </li>
+    <li class="event">
+      <h2>The Mill Ledgers: a Local History Talk</h2>
+      <p><time datetime="2027-02-04T18:00">Thursday 4 February 2027, 6:00 pm</time></p>
+      <p class="event-desc">Walter Pruitt, author of The Fernbrook Mill Ledgers, talks about what three generations of accounts reveal about the town, with time for questions.</p>
+      <p class="event-booking">Booking: needed. Reserve a seat by phone or email.</p>
+    </li>
+  </ol>
+</main>
+
+<footer class="site-footer">
+  <address>
